                <p>or how i learned to enjoy minimalism in contemporary greek architecture.</p>
<p>during our recent vacation we stayed at the agapi beach hotel. at first the clean minimalist architecture did not resonate very strongly with me but after some time i realized that the interaction between light and the simple geometrical shapes is striking. also the contrast between the bold clean surfaces and the beautiful flowers in the garden is a joy to behold.</p>
